    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "9ul6dkrt60hs",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "r2ok8gwtafev"
              ],
              "text": "Dakhla Oasis"
            },
            {
              "_key": "06peosbmgx6y",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Tours"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "r2ok8gwtafev",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58783",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The enchanting Dakhla Oasis, a jewel in Egypt’s vast desert landscape, offers an array of captivating tours that promise to immerse you in its unique blend of nature and history. Most local hotels and restaurants can arrange exhilarating day trips, providing an intimate look at this spectacular region. Picture a day filled with adventure: exploring Al-Gedida and Qalamun, meandering through majestic dunes, rejuvenating at a natural spring, and delving into the historical depths of Al-Qasr. For those who prefer a more personalized experience, local taxi drivers are available to guide you to the more secluded sights, offering half-day excursions tailored to your curiosity."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For the true desert enthusiasts, the Bedouin Camp, managed by experts in camel handling, offers both short and extended camel treks through the mesmerizing desert landscapes surrounding Dakhla. These journeys provide an authentic and unforgettable glimpse into the traditional Bedouin "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "lifestyle"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/category/lifestyle/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/category/lifestyle/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pfb1qel0ypan",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "If your wanderlust beckons you further afield, ensure to verify with the local tourist office that your guide possesses the necessary permits. Dakhla, being one of the gateways to the majestic Gilf Kebir, requires specific authorization from "
            },
            {
              "_key": "g69suf3ul9g2",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "xwwyg1bxlde3"
              ],
              "text": "Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "d46wbgo7vcdw",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " for excursions to this remote area. For detailed information on desert safaris and more, our team is always ready to assist."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "xwwyg1bxlde3",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Nile & Western Desert Odyssey:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ah6e5mesqf5x",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Embark on a journey that takes you from the iconic "
            },
            {
              "_key": "h7o2evc6zb90",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "1x1w166e6nae"
              ],
              "text": "Giza"
            },
            {
              "_key": "1l0qeb8j0bu4",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Pyramids and the historic towns of Memphis and Saqqara to the heart of the Western Desert. Discover the hidden gems of Baharia Oasis, with its unique Pyramid and English Mountains, and unravel the mysteries of ancient burial grounds in the Valley of the Mummies. Experience the stark beauty of the Black and White Deserts, adorned with surreal rock formations. Continue to the alluring Dakhla Oasis, a sanctuary with over 500 hot springs, and visit nearby marvels including the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000e"
              ],
              "text": "Bagawat"
            },
            {
              "_key": "ykatquq0j1p8",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Oasis, with its ancient Christian cemetery and chapel. Conclude this grand tour in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "adxkijwt794p",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "bi65scosomdi"
              ],
              "text": "Luxor"
            },
            {
              "_key": "urihm4fg33mj",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", where the majesty of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000011"
              ],
              "text": "Karnak"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and Luxor temples awaits, before returning to the vibrant city of Cairo for more unforgettable adventures."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/kharga-oasis-travel-guide/cemetery-of-el-bagawat/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/kharga-oasis/cemetery-of-el-bagawat",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
